      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on some predictive modeling for our property theft risk assessment in the midwest. im looking at some zip code data from the last 5 years and noticed a spike in larceny. i want to run a regression to see if there are any demographic shifts that correlate with this. specifically, i want to know if changes in the ethnic composition of these neighborhoods are a statistically significant factor in the rising theft rates. can you help me structure a model to test this?",
